        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Why it Matters: Teton Rock Gym</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/47465.webp" alt="Why it Matters: Teton Rock Gym" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p>The Tin Cup Challenge matters for as many reasons as there are residents of Teton Valley, but here are two: one specific and one general.</p>

<p>Specifically, the Tin Cup Challenge helps us spend more time doing what we love &#8211; which is fostering personal and community growth through the challenge of rock climbing!&nbsp;Fundraising is a challenge for the <a href="https://www.google.com/search?client=safari&amp;rls=en&amp;q=teton+rock+gym&amp;ie=UTF-8&amp;oe=UTF-8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" aria-label="Teton Rock Gym (opens in a new tab)">Teton Rock Gym</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;Our small staff works hard and wears a lot of hats.&nbsp;&nbsp;Being able to participate in Tin Cup helps gives us a great return on the limited capacity we have available for fundraising.&nbsp;&nbsp;Participating in a fun event that the community loves and understands is a huge boon to our ability to raise money to support our mission.</p>

<p>Much more generally, the Tin Cup Challenge is a powerful force toward building a strong culture of philanthropy in Teton Valley.&nbsp;&nbsp;It reminds us of the diversity of the nonprofits in our community, and how we can work together.&nbsp;&nbsp;Importantly, it shows us that fundraising is not a zero sum game &#8211; more nonprofits with more great energy can work together to raise even more money to benefit the community we all love.</p>
        </div>

